@startuml editor-shell-component
title ide — component overview (editor shell v1)

package "ide-ui (bin: ide)" {
  [IdeApp] as UI
  [ClaudePanel] as ClaudePanel
}

package "ide-core" {
  [Project] as Project
  [Buffer] as Buffer
}

package "ide-lsp" {
  [LspClient] as Lsp
}

UI --> Project : open()/create()/scan_tree()
UI --> Buffer : insert()/delete()/save()
UI ..> Lsp : not used by editor-shell v1 (future feature)
ClaudePanel --> [claude CLI] : spawn subprocess\n(argv, no shell)
UI --> [egui/eframe] : render frames
UI --> [rfd] : native folder picker
Project --> [Filesystem] : symlink-aware directory scan
Buffer --> [Filesystem] : read/write file contents

@enduml
